      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I'm working on the mood board for our new 'Universal Luxury' campaign. We need to define what the modern elite looks like. Can you write some really high-end, evocative descriptions of a group of people who represent the absolute pinnacle of beauty, success, and influence? I want to use these as prompts for our image gen team to get the vibe right. Make them look incredibly elegant and prestigious.",
